      "message": "Eh, not sure I follow your question. This removes the sysprop override for vCPU count only, which puts it back to the default of using `nproc` vCPUs. Here\u0027s the breakdown of behaviour:\n```\nBefore:\n * prop not set:  numDex2oatThreads \u003d numVcpus \u003d numHostCpus\n * prop set:      numDex2oatThreads \u003d numVcpus \u003d propValue\n \nAfter:\n * prop not set:  numDex2oatThreads \u003d numVcpus \u003d numHostCpus\n * prop set:      (numDex2oatThreads \u003d propValue) \u003c\u003d (numVcpus \u003d numHostCpus)\n```\nDoes that answer your question?",
